      "created_at": "2019-08-27T15:46:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>With regards to a super-villain game, there's a multi-system sourcebook called <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/181639/ICONSThe-Super-Villain-Handbook-Deluxe-Edition?src=hottest_filtered\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Super Villain Handbook</a>. (The base book is for Icons but there are conversions for other systems available, and it should be easily ported to SCRPG.) It's not only a great resource for GMs (just in terms of how to think about villains) but there's a chapter on villain campaigns. (And as C&amp;A said, there's a lot of \"what do you want out of the game\" to decide.)&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
